OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's on this Christmas in
OL,4,AWolverhampton?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestive markets, theatre shows, family
OL,7,Fattractions and Christmas light
OL,8,Fswitch-on events are set to return to
OL,9,FWolverhampton as the city prepares for
OL,10,Fthe festive season.
OL,12,FResidents and visitors can enjoy
OL,13,Feverything from major theatre
OL,14,Fproductions and live entertainment to
OL,15,FChristmas villages and seasonal
OL,16,Fshopping events.
OL,18,FFestive celebrations will take place
OL,19,Facross Wolverhampton, Bilston,
OL,20,FWednesfield and Tettenhall throughout
OL,21,FNovember and December.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
